title: Proxmox Mail Gateway: Subscription
agents: pmg
catalog: app/pmg
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 Reports the Proxmox subscription status via
 {/nodes/{node}/subscription}: subscription level and next due date
 if one is active. Having no subscription is a normal, expected state
 for community installations and is not flagged as a problem;
 WARN is only raised for an invalid/suspended paid subscription.

item:
 None, one service per host.

discovery:
 One service is created if subscription data is available from the
 API.
